{"resourceIdentifier":"2790","resourceName":"The ARR Cerrado Carbon Project","description":"The ARR Cerrado Carbon Project is located at the Cerrado Biome, in the state of Mato Grosso do Sul, Brazil. It is an AFOLU project, and therefore is classified within scope 14. More specifically, the project falls under the ARR category.\r\nThe ARR Cerrado Carbon Project’s purpose is to remove and reduce GHG emissions through an increase in forestry area and preservation of native vegetation in the state of Mato Grosso do Sul, at the Cerrado biome, initially near the city of Ribas do Rio Pardo. The project also includes the management and implementation of various social activities at the local communities nearby. The carbon credits are a result of the change of land use in previous pasture areas, through the plantation of Eucalyptus species in an area of 38.708 ha (ARR category).\r\nThe plantation activities will be developed in accordance with good forestry practices, and in addition, the project proponents will also seek certification under sustainable programs, such as the FSC, which can confirm the implementation of such practices.","location":{"latitude":-20.405600,"longitude":-53.600800},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-03-08","endExclusive":"2022-04-08","endInclusive":"2022-04-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2790"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Mato Grosso do Sul"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Suzano SA"},{"type":"string","value":"São Paulo, Brazil"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"6840106"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"37032 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 19/07/2019 - 18/07/2119"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=59051&IDKEY=k0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9f81431329","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing Representation- signed.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-12-21T18:46:34.147Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=62965&IDKEY=8lksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku09886828735","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"The ARR Cerrado Carbon Project .pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-08T16:10:23.957Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_OTHER_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Other Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=59052&IDKEY=Dq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhm81432708","documentType":"Communications Agreement","documentName":"Communications Agreement - signed.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-12-21T18:47:02.73Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=72712&IDKEY=8097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87m100269848","documentType":"Other","documentName":"Deed of partial release_2790 Verra signed.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-08-19T20:30:52Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID